  "details": "I was helping someone testing a quest avatar, and was confused why I (on Android) couldn't see their physbones working, even though all the components were within the limits.   But then, I tried switching them from \"Avatar will follow Safety Settings\" to \"Avatar enabled\", and their physbones started working.   That would make sense if physbones were being blocked by my safety settings, but the next thing I did was take a look at the toggles under \"shield levels\", and \"physbones\" doesn't seem to be one of them?  Is something else controlling it, like \"custom animations\"?",
